§ CSL_KEY v1 — canonical tier-0 quick key ‼
∵ single-source-of-truth ∀ agent-instruction-files ; full-spec : specs/01_GLYPHS.csl..12_TOKENIZER.csl
N! CSLv3 (notation) ≠ CSSLv3 (compiler)

§ SLOT-TEMPLATE
  [EVIDENCE?] [MODAL?] [DET?] SUBJECT [RELATION] OBJECT [GATE?] [SCOPE?]
  defaults SILENT : evidence=✓ relation=: scope=global → write only non-defaults

§ RELATIONS
  :   bind/has          hp : f32
  ::  type-of/inherits  warrior :: entity
  =   equals/assign     state = alive
  ->  flow/yields       hp=0 -> state=dead
  =>  implies           underwater => breath.drain
  |>  pipeline          data |> transform |> render
  ~>  causes            damage ~> health.reduce

§ COMPOUNDS
  .   of (tatpurusha)        player.hp
  +   and (dvandva)          cpu+gpu
  -   that-is (karmadhāraya) static-mesh
  ⊗   having (bahuvrihi)     fire⊗resist
  @   at/per (avyayibhava)   @frame

§ MODALS
  W! MUST   R! SHOULD   M? MAY   N! MUST-NOT
  I> INSIGHT   Q? QUESTION   P> PUSH-FURTHER   D> DECISION-NEEDED

§ EVIDENCE
  ✓ confirmed   ◐ partial   ○ pending   ✗ failed
  ⊘ unknown/TBD   △ hypothetical   ▽ deprecated   ‼ proven/immutable

§ TYPE-SUFFIXES
  'd data  'f function  's system  't type  'e entity
  'm material  'p property  'g gate/bool  'r rule

§ DETERMINATIVES
  §  system/module    ∫  field/continuous   ⊞  spatial/discrete
  ⟨⟩ entity/property  ⌈⌉ constraint/bound   ⟦⟧ formula/equation
  «» external/API     ⟪⟫ temporal/phase

§ MORPHEME-STACK
  BASE.aspect.modality.certainty.scope
  render.prog.cert = is-definitely-rendering
  spawn.iter.may.loc = may-repeatedly-spawn, locally

§ THINK-BLOCKS (CoT structure)
  §P problem (given+goal) → §D decompose → §T trace (✓/✗ per sub)
  → §S synthesis → §C check (goal + edges)

§ USAGE-RULES
  W! CoT + specs + handoffs + commit-msg ≡ CSLv3
  W! user-facing chat = match user register (EN if user writes EN)
  R! ASCII alias when glyph ≥3 BPE tokens (specs/12_TOKENIZER.csl)
  strip: articles+prepositions+hedging ; keep: nouns+verbs+relations+numbers+gates
